msgid "vCard preserves more contact details. LDIF is intended for importing into Claws Mail; emergency contacts, social media, free labels and non-JPEG photos cannot be included."
msgstr "vCard zachová více údajů kontaktu. LDIF je určen pro import do Claws Mail; nouzové kontakty, sociální sítě, vlastní popisky a fotografie jiné než JPEG nelze zahrnout.vCard preserves more contact details. LDIF is intended for importing into Claws Mail; emergency contacts, social media, free labels and non-JPEG photos cannot be included."

